  "title": "No-Fail Bean Pie",
  "description": "This bean pie is a traditional Muslim recipe made with canned navy beans, evaporated milk, and sugar. It's similar to pumpkin pie but not as sweet.",
  "authors": [
    "Imam Qadriyyah S Mabel-Doroth"
  ],
